OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster admits child sexual
OL,4,Aabuse offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fraudster dubbed the Lord of Fraud
OL,7,Fhas admitted child sexual abuse
OL,8,Foffences, investigators say.
OL,10,FHugh Rodley, 79, pleaded guilty at
OL,11,FCheltenham Magistrates' Court earlier
OL,12,Fto six counts of making indecent images
OL,13,Fof children and one of possessing such
OL,14,Fimages.
OL,16,FThe self-appointed lord has been jailed
OL,17,Fseveral times previously for serious
OL,18,Ffraud offences, including conning more
OL,19,Fthan 700 pensioners out of #6m.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
