OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster admits child sexual
OL,4,Aabuse offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being found with hundreds of
OL,7,Findecent images of children on his
OL,8,Fdevices, National Crime Agency (NCA)
OL,9,Fsenior investigating officer Andy
OL,10,FLawton said: "Rodley can now add
OL,11,Fhelping fuel the sickening trade in
OL,12,Fchild sexual abuse to his list of
OL,13,Foffences."
